techpack_schema_outline:
TechPack (Zod, src/lib/techpack/schema.ts, JSON export = this object verbatim):
- meta {id, version '1.0', created_at, updated_at, template_id 'bucket_hat'|'generic', generator {primary_model, pipeline_version}, image_hash}
- header {style_number, style_name_en/ar, brand, season, category_en/ar, product_type_en/ar, base_size 'M', units 'cm', date, status draft|reviewed|approved, share_token}
- product {description_en/ar, intended_use_en/ar, fit_intent_en/ar, key_features_en/ar[], reference_observations_en[]}
- sizes[] {code, label_en/ar, fits_note_en ('fits head 57-58 cm'), is_base}
- poms[] {code A..H, name_en/ar, how_to_measure_en/ar, values {S,M,L}, tolerance_cm, derivation ('D = H / π'), source measured|stated|derived|default|inferred, confidence high|medium|low}
- pattern_pieces[] {name_en/ar, qty_per_shell, qty_total, cut_dimensions_base_en, notes_en, net_area_cm2}
- bom[] {ref F1/F2/T1/T2/L1/L2/P1, category fabric|interfacing|thread|label|trim|hardware|packaging|other, item_en/ar, description_en, composition, weight_gsm, width_cm, placement_en/ar, qty_per_unit, unit, colour_rule_en, supplier ('TBC by factory'), notes_en, source, confidence}
- construction {standards {stitch_type '301 lockstitch (ISO 4915)', seam_type, spi_seam, spi_topstitch, seam_allowance_cm 1.0, topstitch_offset_cm 0.6, topstitch_rows 1, needle, thread_seaming, thread_topstitch, interfacing_en, pressing_en}, operations[] {step, operation_en/ar, machine, stitch, spi, notes_en/ar}, sam_estimate_min, sam_note_en, special_notes_en/ar[]}
- colorways[] {code CW1/CW2, name_en/ar, components[] {component_en/ar (outer shell, reverse shell, brim topstitch needle, bobbin, label), colour_name, pantone_tcx '16-0726 TCX', hex '#A39264', bom_ref}, thread_needle, thread_bobbin, label_side_en/ar, notes_en} + colorway_note_en/ar ('both colorways are the same physical hat; differentiate by label side and hangtag')
- labels[] {type, placement_en/ar, content_en/ar (ES 7266-3 fibre %, ES 1405/ISO 3758 care, صنع في مصر / Made in Egypt, manufacturer), notes_en}
- packaging {method_en/ar, items_en[], carton_note_en}
- qc {aql_en 'ISO 2859-1 GII, AQL 2.5 major / 4.0 minor', checks_en/ar[], tests_en[]}
- consumption {fabric_width_cm, usable_width_cm, marker_efficiency, shrinkage_allowance_pct, per_unit[] {colour, net_area_cm2, gross_area_cm2, metres_per_unit, grams_per_unit}, formulas_en[], run_quantity, run_totals_m[]}
- flats[] {id side|top|underside, title_en/ar, svg (inline, viewBox mm, <g id='pom-X'> anchors), pom_codes[]}
- assumptions[] {text_en/ar, impact low|medium|high}
- questions_for_factory[] {text_en/ar}
- readiness {score 0-100, checks[] {item_en, pass, note_en}}
- acknowledgement {status pending|acknowledged, sample_size, units_confirmed, tolerances_accepted, shrinkage_result_pct, thread_available, label_supplier, lead_time_days, acknowledged_by, role, date} | null
- sample_reviews[] {round proto|fit|pp|top, date, comment_en/ar, affected_poms[], measured_values {POM: {size: cm}} | null, out_of_tolerance[], action, author}
- revision_log[] {version, date, author, change_en}
- pipeline {stages[] {name, kind llm|code, model, ms, input_tokens, output_tokens, cache_read_tokens, cost_usd, note}, critique CritiqueReport|null, validation {errors[], warnings[]}, total_cost_usd, total_ms}
LLM-facing schemas (src/lib/ai/llm-schemas.ts) are separate and grammar-safe: VisionObservation, DetailConfirmation, TechPackDraft (hat_base_intent OR generic_poms), CritiqueOutput, SampleCommentNormalised; enums only, .nullable() instead of optional, no numeric bounds, byte-stable so grammar and prompt caches hit.

TechPack (Zod, src/lib/techpack/schema.ts; every *_en string has an *_ar twin; numbers/units/POM codes stay Latin):
- meta {id, version '1.0'.., created_at, updated_at, template_id 'bucket_hat'|'generic', generator {primary_model, pipeline_version}}
- header {style_number, style_name_en/ar, brand, season, category_en/ar, product_type_en/ar, base_size 'M', units 'cm', date, status draft|reviewed|approved}
- product {description_en/ar, intended_use_en/ar, fit_intent_en/ar, key_features_en[]/ar[], reference_observations_en[] (from vision: silhouette notes, construction cues, verbatim text on image)}
- sizes[] {code S|M|L, label_en/ar, fits_note_en 'Fits head 57-58 cm', is_base}
- poms[] {code A..H, name_en/ar, how_to_measure_en/ar, values {S,M,L}, tolerance_cm, derivation 'F = A + 2*pi*C', source measured|stated|derived|default|inferred, confidence high|medium|low}
- pattern_pieces[] {name_en/ar, qty_per_shell, qty_total, cut_dimensions_base_en, notes_en incl. net cut area cm2}
- bom[] {ref F1/F2/T1/T2/L1..L4/P1, category fabric|interfacing|thread|label|trim|hardware|packaging|other, item_en/ar, description_en, composition, weight_gsm, width_cm, placement_en/ar, qty_per_unit, unit, colour_rule_en, supplier 'TBC by factory', notes_en, source, confidence}
- construction {standards {stitch_type '301 lockstitch (ISO 4915)', seam_type, spi_seam '10-12', spi_topstitch '8-9', seam_allowance_cm 1.0, topstitch_offset_cm 0.6, topstitch_rows 1, needle 'DBx1 Nm 80-90', thread_seaming 'Tex 27-30 core-spun poly', thread_topstitch 'Tex 40', interfacing_en, pressing_en}, operations[] {step, operation_en/ar, machine, stitch, spi, notes_en/ar} (14 steps incl. reversible bag-out, turning gap, single brim topstitch closing gap, stitch-in-ditch tacks), sam_estimate_min, sam_note_en, special_notes_en[]/ar[]}
- colorways[] {code CW1/CW2, name_en/ar, components[] {component_en/ar (outer shell, reverse shell, brim topstitch needle/bobbin, label), colour_name, pantone_tcx '16-0726 TCX', hex '#A39264', bom_ref}, thread_needle, thread_bobbin, label_side_en/ar, notes_en}; colorway_note_en/ar (states CW1 and CW2 are the same physical hat, differentiated by label side/hangtag)
- labels[] {type, placement_en/ar, content_en/ar (bilingual fibre %, Made in Egypt / صنع في مصر, ISO 3758 symbols, ES 7266-3 note), notes_en}
- packaging {method_en/ar, items_en[], carton_note_en 'TBC by factory'}
- qc {aql_en 'ISO 2859-1 GII, AQL 2.5 major / 4.0 minor', checks_en[]/ar[], tests_en[] (gsm +/-5%, shrinkage <=3%, colourfastness wash/rub)}
- consumption {fabric_width_cm, usable_width_cm, marker_efficiency, shrinkage_allowance_pct, per_unit[] {colour, net_area_cm2, gross_area_cm2, metres_per_unit, grams_per_unit}, formulas_en[], run_quantity, run_totals_m[]}
- flats[] {id side|top|underside, title_en/ar, svg (mm viewBox, <g id='pom-X'> badges + leaders), pom_codes[]}
- assumptions[] {text_en/ar, impact low|medium|high}; questions_for_factory[] {text_en/ar}
- readiness {score 0-100, checks[15] {item_en, pass, note_en}}
- revision_log[] {version, date, author, change_en}
- pipeline {stages[] {name, kind llm|code, model, ms, input_tokens, output_tokens, cache_read_tokens, cost_usd, note}, critique CritiqueReport|null, validation {errors[], warnings[]}, total_cost_usd, total_ms}
- exports (to add) {version, pdf_en, pdf_ar, xlsx, json, rendered_at}
LLM-facing schemas (llm-schemas.ts) are strict subsets: VisionObservation, DraftCore, DraftProduction (split of TechPackDraft), CritiqueOutput; nullable instead of optional, enums for families/categories/severity, no records, no numeric bounds.
